OL,3,GNEWSAMPs jostle for slice of #14.6m
OL,4,Afrom axed leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree Labour MPs in Bradford have found
OL,7,Fthemselves scrapping it out for a share
OL,8,Fof #14.6m left over from a cancelled
OL,9,Fleisure centre project.
OL,11,FThe Reform UK-led council axed the
OL,12,Flong-planned Squire Lane leisure centre
OL,13,Fproject earlier this year, citing
OL,14,Frising costs.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
