OL,3,GNEWSAMPs jostle for slice of #14.6m
OL,4,Afrom axed leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FShipley MP Anna Dixon had backed calls
OL,7,Fto use some of the money - which comes
OL,8,Ffrom a #20m government grant - to
OL,9,Freopen Bingley Pool, while Bradford
OL,10,FEast MP Imran Hussain said last week he
OL,11,Fwanted a share to help turn a derelict
OL,12,Fbuilding on his patch into a youth and
OL,13,Fcommunity hub.
OL,15,FMeanwhile, Bradford West MP Naz Shah
OL,16,Fhas recently said the cash should stay
OL,17,Fin the constituency it was meant for:
OL,18,F"This money is something that I secured
OL,19,Ffor Bradford West, and I'd like to keep
OL,20,Fit in Bradford West."
